    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「ImageNet」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "ImageNet 之前，视觉数据集更小且常常领域化。ImageNet 把通用目标识别变成数据规模挑战。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-imagenet-a-large-scale-hierarchical-image-database"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "它把图像标签连接到 WordNet synsets，使数据集组织本身也成为科学贡献。 关键机制是大规模层级图像标注，它把资料线索与可见的演示行为连接起来。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-imagenet-a-large-scale-hierarchical-image-database"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 ImageNet 同时视为决定性基准和基准局限的提醒。它的长期影响在于展示了数据规模、标签、排行榜和算力压力如何重塑整个研究领域。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-imagenet-a-large-scale-hierarchical-image-database"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「ImageNet」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
